  pages:
  - title: 01 / Wire the ADC
    explanation: "W01\u2013W03: BIT2, BIT1 and BIT0 to their 20 k\u03A9 inputs. W04\u2013W07:
      B2 OUT to LINK 21 IN, LINK 21 OUT to B1 OUT, B1 OUT to LINK 10 IN, LINK 10
      OUT to B0 OUT. W08\u2013W09: B0 OUT to TERM IN, TERM OUT to REF RETURN. W10:
      SENSOR OUT to SENSOR +. W11: DAC TAP (B2 OUT) to DAC \u2212."
    caption: "3-BIT R\u20132R DAC  \u2022  5 V REFERENCE"
    parts:
    - id: out
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.73}
      label: DAC TAP 0.000 V
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    - id: sensor
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.2, y: 0.95}
      label: SENSOR OUT
