  - title: 02 / Try each bit from B2 to B0
    explanation: The ladder converts each trial code to a voltage. Keep the trial
      bit when the sensor is at or above the DAC. Clear it when the sensor is below
      the DAC. Compare all three bits and submit the final code before loading the
      next sensor.
    caption: "TEST  \u2022  COMPARE  \u2022  KEEP OR CLEAR"
    parts:
    - id: out
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.73}
      label: DAC TAP 2.500 V
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    - id: sensor
      kind: 9
