  - title: 03 / Diagnose swapped inputs
    explanation: "Undo the two comparator leads, cross them and test 100. The comparator
      reports BELOW. Reconnect SENSOR OUT to SENSOR + and DAC TAP to DAC \u2212.
      Now 100 reports ABOVE and 110 reports BELOW."
    caption: "TEST INPUT 3.200 V  \u2022  TRIAL 100 = 2.500 V"
    parts:
    - id: out
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.73}
      label: DAC TAP 2.500 V
