  - title: 04 / Verify all eight bands
    explanation: "Run the sweep with the correct input wiring. It tests the midpoint
      of each band. Code 000 covers 0\u20130.625 V, 001 starts at 0.625 V and 111
      starts at 4.375 V. The lower edge belongs to the new code."
    caption: "000\u2013111  \u2022  0.625 V PER STEP"
    parts:
    - id: out
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.73}
